flowchart LR
  subgraph S1[Before the price is out]
    direction TB
    A([Concert announced, no price]):::start --> B[Team sets estimate range<br/>avg of 3 similar concerts at venue]
    B --> C[Targets use the midpoint<br/>labelled Estimate]
  end
  subgraph S2[When the price is announced]
    direction TB
    E[Team updates list within 48h<br/>or organiser edits manual trip] --> F[Log: date · old → new · source · who]
    F --> G[All linked targets recalculate]
    G --> H[Members notified with<br/>new amount needed]:::fin
  end
  C -- official price announced --> E
  classDef start fill:#C6F45B,stroke:#14111F
  classDef fin fill:#14111F,color:#F3EEFF,stroke:#14111F
